{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_01_beg","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_01","title":"闖入者","storyCode":"SV-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"196c6ea1b50e2466659d7be51826d5a1b423bcc1c11505c86c974cc1d81184d5","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"深夜，斯卡蒂發現醫療艙裡的幽靈鯊失蹤，而擄走她的正是幽靈鯊以前的隊長歌蕾蒂婭。臨走之前，歌蕾蒂婭告訴斯卡蒂，接下來她們將前往一座伊比利亞小城。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"沉默。怪異。捉摸不定。外鄉人。\n他們自然會這麼說。\n陰暗。冷血。見死不救。天生怪物。\n所有人在背後都會這麼說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是啊。\n人只要失去了故鄉，就什麼都不是了。\n照理來說，來到這裡的我，應該能開始一個新的生活。\n只是，過往揮之不去。這些東西會順著影子爬上你的小腿，把你向泥沼深處拽去。\n我們誰都擺脫不了過往。\n如果有一天，你的故鄉找上了你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"2:33 A.M. 天氣/陰\n羅德島本艦，走廊"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦！等這份報告提交完成，你的外勤任務就算結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，又是......空白？咳，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"從頭到尾，只有“完成”兩個字啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"任務確實完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是這樣沒錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......你多寫兩句話也不會有什麼問題吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎麼辦......比想像的還難對付？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（之前沒和她說過什麼話，這回說是要和她對接，雖然組長提醒過......但果然還是很難辦。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的，我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"關於任務中的細節，如果博士有疑問，會再找你確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，凱爾希醫生說你也許不會想向她提交報告......她還說阿米婭對你太溫柔了，這樣下去是不行的......之類。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"然後就把這次任務歸檔到博士那邊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"這個女人，哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那你想直接向博士面呈報告嗎？現在博士好像不在，你可以休息幾天，等博士回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你提交的這份報告，真的很需要再補充！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"很麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，任務編碼F1071，確認提交，後續補充——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"把檔案還給我。我想起來，再完善點內容也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！當然可以！那就麻煩你啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（比預想的要順利一些啊......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的話，我這邊沒什麼事了，還請回去好好休......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你的臉色一下子就變了，發生什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？在這裡？船上嗎？難道是入侵者？！聽人說你五感特別敏銳，難道是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不對啊，如果船上有危險，警報會響起來吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......歌聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"歌？什麼歌？呃，很安靜啊，我沒聽見......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，為什麼會有歌聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"確實好像有些嗡嗡聲，但那也不是歌吧？羅德島上的各類儀器都還在運轉，有可能是，是機械振動？你還不習慣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不，氣味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"海水的味道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......斯卡蒂？你有點嚇到我了。你在說什......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？喂！斯卡蒂！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂跑得太急、太快，她跑進樓梯通道，她害怕乘電梯幾秒間的焦慮就會讓那氣味溜走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個獵人走上海岸♪\n她能聽到這歌。這艘船上的大多數人，他們聽不見。\n這種語言，這種旋律，喚起了她的回憶。她不是個戀舊的人，但她太熟悉了。\n但......不該這樣。這首歌不該出現在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他的家鄉在後，徒餘哀歎♪\n歌聲在這艘船的管道裡遊移。\n海水的氣味從艙壁裡不斷滲出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂也同樣記得這味道。潮濕逼近了她，她的皮膚不住地收縮、繃緊。緊張，卻也是激動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"難道她醒了？她不禁加快了腳步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"幽靈鯊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"她拉開醫療艙的門。\n床鋪是空的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"也有可能是清醒了以後想出去走走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等......這是什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她撿起那個東西，捏了捏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......好像是她的東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幽靈鯊的金鏈被隨便地丟在地上。或許是故意的。\n她很討厭這東西嗎？那她肯定是不喜歡現在自己的身份了。\n教會，至少海裡教會的所有事，都不是好事。\n但......不對勁。\n外人。\n不知為什麼，斯卡蒂突然想起了這個詞。\n她意識到那其實不是幽靈鯊的氣味。\n比起以前的幽靈鯊，現在這氣味太濃烈，又太冷酷。斯卡蒂懷疑自己只是被驚喜沖昏了頭腦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就在這附近。你是誰？出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是深海獵人。但不是幽靈鯊。竟然還有其他活下來的深海獵人！\n但為什麼在這裡？\n......幽靈鯊去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......無論你是誰或者你是什麼。出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她得去追。有什麼不對勁。她感到對方的確在附近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂衝出房門，一個身影在走廊深處一閃而過。\n不......有兩個人。歌聲仍在，對方仍在低吟。\n幽靈鯊。那個深海獵人帶走了幽靈鯊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真慢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再不過來，我們可就要走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"獵人！你是誰？"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂一躍，轉過角落，她不自主地摸索起身上能用的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"——你在做什麼？"},{"type":"narration","text":"那一刻她竟先直視了對方的雙眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，你是......"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個自己沒有想過的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"氣色不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......難道是二大隊的，幽靈鯊的隊長......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......歌蕾蒂婭......？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有些時日了，斯卡蒂。你還能記起阿戈爾的歌，我很欣慰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂沒能從她的表情裡摳出哪怕一絲絲的“欣慰”。這個女人，從自己知道她開始，表情就從來沒變過。\n高挑的女性抱著幽靈鯊。數年來，斯卡蒂唯一知曉還存活的深海獵人，幽靈鯊，現在正靠在歌蕾蒂婭的肩上，做著又一場難得平靜的夢。\n在幽靈鯊的隊長吐出第一個詞的同時，歌聲消失了。\n斯卡蒂一陣恍惚。從舷窗湧入、獨屬陸地的乾燥的風拂過斯卡蒂略顯乾燥的面頰，她心想，這個獵人還活著，歌蕾蒂婭活著。斯卡蒂終於又找到了一個同類。\n不對。是歌蕾蒂婭找到了她們。只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......我以為你死了。你們拼死讓我們過去的。我以為你們全死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"生命可貴。很高興看到你也活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"既然幽靈鯊還活著，我也常在想，你們二隊是不是還能有其他人活下來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎麼找到這裡的？幽靈鯊......她還是待在病房比較好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂印象裡最嚴厲的獵人之一，在這時選擇了一言不發。\n懷疑在斯卡蒂心裡滋生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"她變了很多。她現在未必認識你，她的身體也還很虛弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虛弱？獵人不會虛弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你來陸地上多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"地上的病，特殊的病，在掏空她的身體。這艘船上的人能穩定她的病情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"這些年過來，她從來沒清醒過。現在的幽靈鯊是另外一個人。我不知道是什麼把她變成了這樣。"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭沒說話，微風吹過，歌蕾蒂婭的髮絲隨之飄蕩，掩住了她的眼神。\n斯卡蒂意識到了問題所在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......歌蕾蒂婭。你就是歌蕾蒂婭，我不會認錯人。但你要做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你想帶她去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以為獵人在陸地上是自由的。我是不是理解錯了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不，歌蕾蒂婭......她還睡著。她想不想走，你沒問過她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你想從這帶走她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的這些新同僚，你似乎對他們青睞有加。他們對你是否也一樣？你隨手就能捏碎他們的脊樑，又怎麼能不讓他們感到恐懼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"陸地上的這些人對我們有敵意也正常，但這艘船上的不會。我遇到的不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我還沒能理解你放鬆警惕的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不......這件事我不想他們摻和，問題也不在我身上，不在他們身上。"},{"type":"narration","text":"問題在你。\n斯卡蒂往前走了一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你這麼做是什麼意思，你最好說明清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"獵人斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——在陸地上我不用執政官的身份約束你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我也沒有義務向你坦白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只是認為，我應該讓你知道，是我帶走了她，我自己的隊員。這就足夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今晚的你還不需要知道原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"但是幽靈鯊她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——（伊比利亞語）——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在那個名字完整地傳到斯卡蒂耳朵裡之前，歌蕾蒂婭就已自舷窗滑進了艦外的月色，幽靈鯊癱軟的身體也隨之一起消失了。\n斯卡蒂沒有伸手去抓，她動都沒動。\n她清楚，歌蕾蒂婭想跑，自己是怎麼都追不上的；但如果歌蕾蒂婭只是想跑，那就不會給自己留下訊息。\n她在求助，或者她在誘騙自己。斯卡蒂將信將疑，又別無他法。至少她沒命令自己去做什麼，別去做什麼。\n“鹽風城。”\n歌蕾蒂婭是這麼說的。\n斯卡蒂她不得不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"鹽風城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......這重逢也太不感人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們在這幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，她是斯卡蒂吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我是覺得她有點眼熟。和畫像有點像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊！哈哈，得來全不費工夫啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"是斯卡蒂沒錯，我們蹲對地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，她真應了......而且你看她那把劍。她真的是斯卡蒂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂，你還記得“上尉”嗎？我們拿了他的錢，要給他報仇，要你的命！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你頭殼壞了......你頭殼壞了！我就說這是個餿主意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不是說拿了他的錢騙騙人就好嗎？！什麼報仇啊，什麼拿懸賞啊，怎麼可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你想想那些傳聞！真要是她，這趟活我們還能賺到錢嗎？命都要賠上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我看我們還是趁早散了吧！拿上你的破銅爛鐵逃吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"呸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己爬回到你的爛床上抱著馱獸的尿喊媽媽去吧。一個長頭髮的年輕姑娘就讓你嚇破了膽。想讓老子無功而返，沒門！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"說得對！就算她真的是斯卡蒂，就算斯卡蒂再怎麼厲害，那她現在也只有一個人對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我們有一、二......呃，好多個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"可是那些厲害的賞金獵人不都爛在了地裡？那時候，她也是一個人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你再想想，你每次說自己人多的時候，真的會有好事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"有誰看見了？要我說，那幾個傢伙，說不定是夜裡喝醉了進了同一個漂亮庫蘭塔的屋裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"結果人家從褲襠裡掏出弩來一陣亂射，把大家的腦袋都給轟爛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"傳聞就是那麼回事，要是不誇大些，那些抱著琴唱歌的，那什麼吟遊歌手，他們還能有飯吃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼一劍能劈開五十座山啊......老子還能一拳頭打穿倫蒂尼姆呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"聽我說兄弟們！想吃飯的就跟我一塊上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"管她斯卡蒂活卡蒂的，我們在這把她弄死，之後不怕人搶金子！加上其他人懸賞她腦袋的錢，下半輩子根本不用愁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"給你們個機會。現在跑還來得及，我沒時間和你們折騰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"上啊！宰了她！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈爾語）爛掉的海草最黏人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到，不會變的就只有劣質賞金獵人的愚蠢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["羅德島幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
